A: (@draw k_ill k1@) How do you say I'm bored in Russian? You already have the frame: мне (@draw k_cold k2@) пло́хо, мне хо́лодно.

A: The feeling comes to you, мне, and the same (@draw k_q@) мне carries bored, sad, having fun and scared.

    erase k_ill k1 k_cold k2 k_q

A: Ску́чно, with a real ч: мне ску́чно, I'm bored.
    draw f_skuch w_skuch

B: Ве́село is fun, cheerful: мне ве́село, I'm having fun.
    draw f_vesel w_vesel

A: Гру́стно is sad: мне гру́стно. The т is silent: грусно.
    draw f_grust w_grust

B: Стра́шно is frightening: мне стра́шно, I'm scared.
    draw f_strash w_strash

A: And интере́сно: мне интере́сно, I'm interested; it's interesting to me.
    draw f_inter w_inter

A: All five end in о, like хо́лодно, and none takes я: never я ску́чно.
    highlight w_skuch w_vesel w_grust w_strash w_inter color #2f6b8f part о$

    erase f_skuch f_vesel f_grust f_strash f_inter w_skuch w_vesel w_grust w_strash w_inter

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Now listen: Tom and Masha at the cinema, an hour into a long film.
    draw cinema

A: Ма́ша, тебе́ интере́сно?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    draw balloon_m

    ask "How does she feel? Listen for the word after мне." voice b options ["scared","sad","bored"] correct 3 reveal.text "Мне ску́чно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: No, I'm bored. Let's go home!
        listen: Нет, мне ску́чно. Дава́й пойдём домо́й!
        right: Bored: мне ску́чно. And she wants to go home.
        wrong: Bored: мне ску́чно, the word for a long, dull film.

    erase balloon_m cinema

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: For someone else's feeling, (@draw o_man o_man_f o_emu@) swap мне for their to-word: ему́ гру́стно, he's sad.

B: Ей ве́село: she's having fun.
    draw o_wom o_wom_f o_ei

A: And to ask a (@draw o_tebe@) friend: тебе́ ску́чно? Are you bored?

    erase o_man o_man_f o_emu o_wom o_wom_f o_ei o_tebe

B: Yesterday's feeling (@draw p_cal p_line@) takes бы́ло: вчера́ мне (@draw p_like@) бы́ло ску́чно.

    erase p_cal p_line p_like

A: One feeling works the other (@draw r_tom r_rad@) way: рад, glad. Here it's я: я рад.

B: Я ра́да.
    draw r_mas r_rada

A: (@draw r_like@) A woman adds а, as in свобо́ден and свобо́дна.
    highlight r_rada color #c0392b part а$

A: And when you meet a friend: (@draw r_see@) рад тебя́ ви́деть, glad to see you.

    erase r_tom r_rad r_mas r_rada r_like r_see

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Saturday evening, a party with music. Tom meets Masha and her brother. Listen, then practise it.
    draw notes

    erase notes

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

A: Е́сли ему́ ску́чно: he's bored now, so no бу́дет; бу́дет is for (@draw esli2@) what's still to come.
    draw esli

    erase esli esli2

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw q_yawn

    quiz "The film is long and dull. Which is right?" reveal.text "Мне ску́чно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Мне ску́чно: the feeling comes to you.
        wrong: A dull film, and the feeling comes to you: мне.
        * Мне ве́село.
        + Мне ску́чно.
        * Я ску́чно.

    erase q_yawn

    draw q_wom q_sad

    quiz "She is sad. Which is right?" reveal.text "Ей гру́стно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ей: her to-word.
        wrong: Not она́: the feeling comes to her. And ему́ is him.
        + Ей гру́стно.
        * Она́ гру́стно.
        * Ему́ гру́стно.

    erase q_wom q_sad

    draw q_w1 q_wave q_w2

    quiz "A woman meets a friend. What does she say?" reveal.text "Ра́да тебя́ ви́деть!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Ра́да: рад takes я, and a woman adds а.
        wrong: Рад doesn't take мне, and she is a woman.
        * Рад тебя́ ви́деть!
        * Мне ра́да!
        + Ра́да тебя́ ви́деть!

    erase q_w1 q_wave q_w2

    draw q_film q_yawn2

    ask "A dull Sunday at home. Say you're bored, and suggest the cinema." voice b show cue test t1
        gloss: I'm bored. Let's go to the cinema!
        say_it: Мне ску́чно. Дава́й пойдём в кино́!

B: Мне ску́чно. Дава́й пойдём в кино́!
    draw q_say

    erase q_film q_yawn2 q_say

    draw q_wom3 q_yawn3

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I think she's bored." answer ["по-моему ей скучно","по-моему, ей скучно","по моему ей скучно","я думаю что ей скучно","я думаю, что ей скучно","я думаю ей скучно"] reveal.text "По-мо́ему, ей ску́чно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ ,-
        right: По-мо́ему, ей ску́чно: her feeling, her to-word.
        wrong: Start with по-мо́ему, then her to-word, then ску́чно.

    erase q_wom3 q_yawn3

    group board members ["b1","b2"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So in Russian a feeling comes to you: мне ску́чно, ему́ гру́стно, ей ве́село.
    highlight b1 color #5b8c5a effect underline

B: Of the feelings, only рад takes я, with а for a woman.
    highlight b2 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase board

B: Мне бы́ло ве́село! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 430 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_face size 90 set twemoji x 590 y 520 or ["smiling face"] icon_look picture of "grinning face"
    text end_say "Мне бы́ло ве́село! Пока́!" say "Мне бы́ло ве́село! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_face end_say

